      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "✓ Subtasks genuinely PARALLEL hain (ek dusre pe depend nahi)\n✓ Har subtask ka context bada hai → isolation ka real fayda hai\n✓ Outcome VERIFIABLE hai (warna N agents = N× hallucination)\n\nClassic fit: 'in 8 repos mein X pattern dhundo' — 8 parallel readers,\nhar ek apna context, ek synthesizer final answer banata hai.",
      "originalText": "✓ Subtasks genuinely PARALLEL hain (ek dusre pe depend nahi)\n✓ Har subtask ka context bada hai → isolation ka real fayda hai\n✓ Outcome VERIFIABLE hai (warna N agents = N× hallucination)\n\nClassic fit: 'in 8 repos mein X pattern dhundo' — 8 parallel readers,\nhar ek apna context, ek synthesizer final answer banata hai.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
