      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "✗ Task inherently sequential hai (step 2 ko step 1 ka result chahiye)\n✗ Agents ko shared mutable state chahiye → race conditions\n✗ Latency-sensitive hai (fan-out = slowest worker ki latency)\n✗ Sirf isliye ki 'multi-agent cool lagta hai'\n\nCost: 3 workers = 3× tokens, aur orchestrator + synthesizer ke\n2 extra LLM calls. Aksar 5–10× ek single agent se.",
      "originalText": "✗ Task inherently sequential hai (step 2 ko step 1 ka result chahiye)\n✗ Agents ko shared mutable state chahiye → race conditions\n✗ Latency-sensitive hai (fan-out = slowest worker ki latency)\n✗ Sirf isliye ki 'multi-agent cool lagta hai'\n\nCost: 3 workers = 3× tokens, aur orchestrator + synthesizer ke\n2 extra LLM calls. Aksar 5–10× ek single agent se.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
